<title>CHILE: Codelco El Teniente pit signs wage deal til 2002.</title>
<headline>Codelco El Teniente pit signs wage deal til 2002.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean state copper company Codelco's El Teniente division and mine unions signed a new four-year collective wage deal which will be in force until January 2002, said El Teniente in a statement.</p>
<p>The agreement was the result of early negotiations to replace the existing wage pact which expires at the end of the year.</p>
<p>Details of the collective contract were not available.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
